get.description:
High-level database statistics for the dashboard.

Read-hot aggregation cached in Redis (default TTL) via cache-aside;
a Redis failure degrades to a direct aggregation.

post.description:
Trigger a static page generation job (administrator-only).

Request body::

    {
        "gene_ids": ["Glyma.01G000100", "Glyma.02G000200"] | null
    }

If ``gene_ids`` is ``None``, all genes will be rebuilt.
